+  * lab-display additionally provides inherited-register/PWM test fixtures.
+- * Neither models physical peripherals. UART extensions, PMIC and storage
+- * remain absent.
++ * Neither models physical peripherals. Explicit lab-power/MSDC fixtures are
++ * synthetic; storage uses a separately selected read-only raw file backend.
+  */
